This repository currently contains documentation, shell and Python scripts, and
example configuration. There is no product code and there are no compiled
dependencies. When the tool described in docs/roadmap.md is built, it will
depend on acemq-java-rabbitmq-admin, which is Apache-2.0 and part of this
project, and on a YAML parser and a CLI framework whose licences will be
recorded here at that point.

scripts/blue-green-lab.sh runs the official RabbitMQ Docker images. Those are
distributed under their own terms by their publishers and are not redistributed
here.

The design in this repository derives from an earlier implementation by the same
author at felipeg48/infra-blue-green-deployment. docs/prior-art.md records what
was carried forward and what was deliberately left behind.
